<br />[*]farmhouse/cabin fridges;
<br />[*][url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Hopper]hoppers[/url]﻿ (these act just like chests, except they're output-only);
<br />[*][url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Junimo_Chest]Junimo chests[/url]﻿;
<br />[*][url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Mini-Fridge]mini-fridges[/url]﻿;
<br />[*]and [url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Mini-Shipping Bin]mini-shipping bins[/url]﻿.
