<br />[/list]Automated machines will give you the same XP, achievements, and items you'd get for using them directly.
<br />
<br />
<br />[size=6][b]Advanced techniques[/b][/size]
<br />[size=4][b]Automate many machines[/b][/size]
<br />You can connect any number of chests and machines into a 'machine group', just by placing each chest/machine so it's touching another one. You can press [font=Courier New]U[/font] (configurable) to visualise your machine groups. See [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/Automate#examples]some machine setups[/url] for examples.
<br />
<br />If you add multiple chests to the same machine group, they'll all be used 
<br />in the automation. Input will be taken from all the chests, and output 
<br />will be sent to chests in this order:
<br />[list=1]
<br />[*]chests edited using [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/518]Chests Anywhere[/url]﻿ to enable 'prefer this chest for output';
<br />[*]chests which already contain an item of the same type;
<br />[*]any chest.
<br />[/list]
<br />[b][size=4]Connectors[/size][/b]
<br />You can configure objects or paths as connectors, which link machines together. For example, here are wooden paths used as connectors:
<br />[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/stable/Automate/docs/screenshots/connectors.png[/img]
<br />
<br />To use path connectors, just enable the checkboxes in [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu[/url].
<br />
<br />[b][size=4]Junimo chests[/size][/b]
<br />Every machine and chest connected to a [url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Junimo_Chest]Junimo chest [/url]is part of a global machine group. This global group behaves just like a regular machine group (including for [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/develop/Automate#machine-priority]machine priority[/url]), even if it's spread across many locations.
<br />
<br />For example, you can use this to distribute automation across the world:
<br />[list=1]
<br />[*]Junimo huts on your farm collect crops;
<br />[*]kegs in a shed turn them into juice/wine;
<br />[*]cellar casks age the juice/wine;
<br />[*]the shipping bin collects the final output
<br />[/list]
<br />See [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/develop/Automate#junimo-chests][i]Junimo chests[/i][/url] in the readme for more info.
<br />
<br />[b][size=4]Machine pipelines[/size][/b]
<br />Want to get super fancy? Machine pipelines let you transfer items between multiple machine groups, set up item filter rules, handle overflow, etc. See [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/develop/Automate#machine-pipelines][i]machine pipelines[/i][/url] in the readme for more info.
<br />
<br />
<br />[size=6][b]Compatibility[/b][/size][list]
<br />[*]Compatible with...[list]
<br />[*]Stardew Valley 1.6.15 or later;
<br />[*]Linux, macOS, and Windows;
<br />[*]single-player;
<br />[*]split-screen and multiplayer. [b]Note:[/b] Automate must be installed by the main player, and is optional for farmhands. See [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/Automate#in-multiplayer-who-gets-xp-and-whose-professions-apply][i]In multiplayer, who gets XP and whose professions apply?[/i][/url] in the FAQs.
<br />[/list]
<br />[*]No known mod conflicts.
<br />[/list]
<br />Pairs well with...
<br />[list]
<br />[*][url=https://smapi.io/mods/#better-Junimos]Better Junimos[/url] adds more crop automation (like replanting) and other improvements.
<br />[*][url=https://smapi.io/mods/#deluxe-grabber-redux]Deluxe Grabber Redux[/url] makes auto-grabbers collect nearby animal products, forage, crops, and indoor pot crops too.
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21730]Filtered Chest Hopper[/url]﻿﻿ enables advanced [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/Automate#machine-pipelines]machine pipelines[/url].
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/28261]Machine Control Panel[/url] lets you control which items each machine type accepts.
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5176]Non-Destructive NPCs[/url] prevents NPCs from destroying chests and machines.
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21294]Workbench Helper[/url] lets you chain chests to workbenches for manual crafting.
<br />[/list]
<br />Mod interactions:
<br />[list]
<br />[*]Expanded Storage works fine with Automate, but it'll change [url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Auto-Grabber]Auto-Grabbers[/url]﻿ to store items output by machines too.
<br />[*]Qi Chests works fine with Automate, except that Automate will currently 
<br />treat all Qi chests as part of the single Junimo chest network.[/list]
<br />
<br />[size=6][b]For mod authors[/b][/size]
<br />Automate supports most machines out of the box, but you can extend Automate through its API if needed. See [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/blob/develop/Automate/docs/technical.md#extensibility-for-modders][i]extensibility for modders[/i] in the readme[/url] for more info.
